<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Low recoil for holos and low recoil weapons besides cav </Major>
    <Description>Bind to left mouse button (fire button)
800 dpi mouse 
8 horizontal
12 verticle
50 ads
1920x1080
16:10
Works for Holos and any variant and some low recoil ARs such as blackbeard and capitaos ARs.


Note* Cav is unplayable her guns recoil is already extremely low and this drags it down too much to be practicle.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>Delay 15 ms
MoveR 4 4
Delay 15 ms
MoveR 0 8
Delay 15 ms
MoveR 0 10
Delay 15 ms
MoveR -4 4
Delay 15 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six Siege</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>